{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2023-05-01 10:14:00', 'title': 'ADDING MULTIMEDIA CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT UNVEILS PLANS TO ADD HOTEL TOWER TO PARIS LAS VEGAS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GUESTS WILL SOON SAY “AU REVOIR” TO THE JUBILEE TOWER AT HORSESHOE LAS VEGAS AND “BONJOUR” TO THE VERSAILLES TOWER AT PARIS LAS VEGAS. CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT HAS UNVEILED PLANS TO RENOVATE THE JUBILEE TOWER AT HORSESHOE LAS VEGAS AND INTEGRATE IT INTO PARIS LAS VEGAS WITH A NEW NAME, VERSAILLES TOWER. *HIGH-RES RENDERINGS CAN BE FOUND HERE* AN INVESTMENT EXCEEDING $100 MILLION, THE VERSAILLES TOWER WILL FEATURE A NEW EXTERIOR AND INTERIOR. THE RENOVATION WILL INTRODUC.'}